<title>USA: Columbus aquires 68.4 pct of Spreckles.</title>
<headline>Columbus aquires 68.4 pct of Spreckles.</headline>
<dateline>AMHERST, N.Y. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Columbus McKinnon Corp said on Thursday that it has received and accepted about 68.4 percent of Spreckels Industries Inc in its tender offer to aquire the company.</p>
<p>It said 5,095,055 shares of the Spreckels common stock were tendered at $24 per share cash.</p>
<p>Columbus also said that all outstanding shares not tendered and purchased so far will be acquired in a subsequent second-step merger at the same price of $24.00 in cash.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
